(4) DIRECTIONAL BIN — de Graaff+ 2024 (6 JADES dwarfs, z=5.5-7.4) and the rest of the sweep
====================================================================================================
  ID          z      v(re)  sigma0  re_kpc  logMdyn   g_dyn/a0(canon)
  00016745  5.566    105    55.0     1.6    10.23        7.7
  00019606  5.890      5    39.1     0.6     9.17        4.8
  00022251  5.799    148    37.0     0.6     9.68       15.4
